-----------
 issuepack
-----------

Pack issues into your repo.

```sh
uv tool install .
issuepack new "Fix login redirect" -m "Return to the original page after login."
issuepack ls {search query} --status {open | closed}
issuepack edit 1
issuepack edit 1 --status closed
issuepack edit 1 -m "Append an update to the body."
issuepack help edit
```
